        "content": {
          "content_type": "text",
          "parts": [
            "If you're looking for a **free alternative to Doodle** for scheduling meetings, here are the best options:\n\n1. **\ue200entity\ue202[\"software\",\"Calendly\",\"meeting scheduling software\"]\ue201**\n   * Best for: One-on-one meetings\n   * Free plan includes:\n     * 1 event type\n     * Google, Outlook, Office 365, and iCloud calendar integration\n     * Automatic time zone detection\n   * Great if you mostly book discovery calls or client meetings.\n\n2. **\ue200entity\ue202[\"software\",\"When2meet\",\"group scheduling tool\"]\ue201**\n   * Best for: Finding a time that works for groups\n   * Completely free\n   * No account required\n   * Participants simply mark when they're available.\n   * Very similar to Doodle's original polling concept.\n\n3. **\ue200entity\ue202[\"software\",\"Zcal\",\"calendar scheduling software\"]\ue201**\n   * Best for: Beautiful booking pages\n   * Free plan includes unlimited booking links\n   * Modern interface\n   * Works well for agencies and consultants.\n\n4. **\ue200entity\ue202[\"software\",\"Zeeg\",\"appointment scheduling software\"]\ue201**\n   * Best for: Privacy-focused scheduling\n   * Generous free plan\n   * Calendar integrations\n   * Booking links and reminders\n\n5. **\ue200entity\ue202[\"software\",\"Cal.com\",\"open-source scheduling software\"]\ue201**\n   * Best for: Flexibility and customization\n   * Free individual plan\n   * Google and Outlook integration\n   * Open source, so it's highly customizable.\n\n6. **\ue200entity\ue202[\"software\",\"Google Forms\",\"online forms software\"]\ue201**\n   * Best for: Simple availability polls\n   * Create a form with several date/time options\n   * Free with a Google account\n   * Not automated, but very effective for coordinating groups.\n\n### My recommendation based on your use case\n\nSince you're running **The Luxora Collective** and scheduling sales calls, interviews, and podcasts:\n\n- **For booking sales calls:** Use **\ue200entity\ue202[\"software\",\"Calendly\",\"meeting scheduling software\"]\ue201** or **\ue200entity\ue202[\"software\",\"Zcal\",\"calendar scheduling software\"]\ue201**.\n- **For interviewing multiple candidates or finding a time that works for several people:** Use **\ue200entity\ue202[\"software\",\"When2meet\",\"group scheduling tool\"]\ue201**.\n- **If you specifically like Doodle's polling feature:** **When2meet** is probably the closest free alternative."
          ]
        },
